aggregated to nine (model, editor, layer) cells per scheme. The full-model NF4 result narrows the phenomenon rather than reducing C2 to one cell:
INT8 and edited-layer NF4 preserve the ranking on both validated-law cells, whereas
full-model NF4 preservation is supported only on Llama-3.2-1B L12. The reconstruction-gap
signature is descriptive; the amended concentration axis remains unadjudicated.

