\section{Experimental Setup}
\label{sec:setup}

\textbf{Harness.} Real bitsandbytes kernels (bitsandbytes 0.49.2, INT8 vectorwise, NF4
double-quant); FP32 value optimization for ROME. Full-model arm uses a cache: non-edited
block linears are quantized once per scheme; only the edited tensor is re-quantized per
edit.

\textbf{Models.} Llama-3.2-1B~\cite{llama3herd2024} at L12 (primary cell), Llama-3.2-3B
at L24 (mandatory second validated-law cell), Qwen-2.5-1.5B~\cite{qwen252024} at L21
(degeneracy datapoint: $\rho_{\mathrm{fp32}}^{\mathrm{within}} \approx 0$ at this layer,
so C2 is not gated there).

