seed-spread hash.

\textbf{Software.} bitsandbytes 0.49.2 in the project's dl conda environment.
AutoGPTQ, AutoAWQ, and llama.cpp are ask-first installs (Track-1.5/Track-2 SKIP /
PENDING respectively).

\textbf{Hardware.} NVIDIA RTX 5090 (24~GB VRAM, CUDA 12.8, Ubuntu 22.04) and an
additional NVIDIA-vGPU instance (32~GB, CUDA 12.8). Both ran the same experiment
code and software stack.

